###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/correlated_over
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/correlated_over> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                        rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                        rdfs:label "correlated_over (slot)" ;
                                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Which axis `covariance` indexes — `node` (equivalently `region`) for spatially correlated drive, or `state` for correlation between the noise on different state variables. Required whenever `covariance` is set: a covariance without a named axis does not identify a process. A multi-mode model carries its modes inside the state axis, so a modal covariance is declared over `state`." ;
                                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> ;
                                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "correlated_over" .


