                             rdfs:label "ramp (slot)" ;
                             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "For method=from_working_point: the parameter + domain to ramp quasi-statically (warm-start, from_previous) to reach the working point; the run then seeds from the ramp endpoint. Reuses ExplorationAxis (parameter + Range domain) — the same primitive an Exploration warm-start uses; the per-step settle comes from the experiment's integration (transient, else duration)." ;
