                            rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                            rdfs:label "sel (slot)" ;
                            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "SLICE: label-based selector (xarray ``.sel``), keyed by dimension (reuses ``Argument``; name = dim, value = coordinate label), taking the nearest coordinate for a numeric selection. Never positional — picks e.g. one operating point out of a swept branch by its parameter value." ;
                            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/common> ;
                            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "sel" .


###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/selection
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/selection> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                  rdfs:label "selection (slot)" ;
                                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Optional best-iterate selection. Absent, the tuned state is the final iterate. Declared, the iterate with the best `criterion` (across all stages, or per stage under `scope: stage`) is restored before the post-tuning evaluation, and `<algorithm>__selected_iteration` / `<algorithm>__selected_value` record which one it was (one value per stage under `scope: stage`)." ;
                                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> ;
                                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "selection" .


