                              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Exploration axes spanning the search space, keyed by the dotted parameter reference each axis sweeps (e.g. \"ReducedWongWang.w\" or \"FastLinearCoupling.G\"). Insertion order is preserved and defines the grid axis order. Each axis references an existing Parameter and supplies the Range to sweep; no new Parameter is created here." ;
                              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> ;
                              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "space" .


