<https://w3id.org/tvbo/study/templates> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                        rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                        rdfs:label "templates (study)" ;
                                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The kinds of study this record covers, keyed by the name ``tvbo study init --template`` takes. An entry's ``in_templates`` names one of these, so a template that nothing declares is a typo rather than a silently empty variant." ;
                                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/study> ;
                                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "templates" .


