###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/update_start
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/update_start> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                     rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                     rdfs:label "update_start (slot)" ;
                                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Simulated time, counted from the start of each stage (or of the run when there are no stages), before which the update rules are not applied: an iteration applies its update only if its simulation period ends at or after this time. In the same unit as `simulation_period`. Absent, every iteration applies its update. A rule taken in through `includes` keeps the start of the algorithm it comes from." ;
                                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> ;
                                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "update_start" .


