                                       rdfs:label "AlgorithmStage" ;
                                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "One stage of a multi-stage tuning schedule. The algorithm body runs once per stage, in order, each stage overriding n_iterations and selected hyperparameters — so a schedule can anneal a learning rate or widen an estimation window as tuning proceeds." ;
