                                       rdfs:label "CohortGrouping" ;
                                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "How a cohort rule cuts its candidates into groups along a measure. The values and their meaning are those of ``tvbo.analysis.statistics.group_index``, which a grouped statistic uses too." ;
                                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/study> ;
