                                                                  owl:onProperty <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo_class> ;
                                                                  owl:maxCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
                                                                ] ;
                                                rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                                rdfs:label "ExperimentResultSidecar" ;
                                                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Descriptor for a cached ``ExperimentResult``: the ``.h5`` companion holding the fitted parameter arrays, one ``CachedArray`` entry per array, and the provenance a downstream cache needs to decide whether the result is still valid. Written by ``tvbo.data.experiment_result_io.save_sidecar``, so it is generated rather than authored — but it is self-describing (it carries a ``tvbo_class`` envelope naming this class), which is what lets ``tvbo validate schema`` check a generated sidecar instead of falling back to some unrelated class and failing on its required slots." ;
                                                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ExperimentResultSidecar> ;
                                                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .


