###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/GeneralizedHopf
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/GeneralizedHopf> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                        rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Bifurcation> ,
                                                        [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
