                              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "One mark bound to one data reference, with its encoding." ;
                              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/figure> .


###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/LayoutEngine
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LayoutEngine> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                     owl:equivalentClass [ rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                           owl:unionOf ( <https://w3id.org/tvbo/LayoutEngine#compressed>
                                                                         <https://w3id.org/tvbo/LayoutEngine#constrained>
                                                                         <https://w3id.org/tvbo/LayoutEngine#none>
                                                                         <https://w3id.org/tvbo/LayoutEngine#tight>
                                                                       )
                                                         ] ;
                                     rdfs:subClassOf owl:Thing ;
                                     rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                     rdfs:label "LayoutEngine" ;
                                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Which matplotlib layout engine positions the mosaic's axes. Unset lets the backend pick (bsplot asks for 'compressed' and falls back to 'tight'), which is right for a plain grid of plots. A figure whose panels carry their own absolute geometry — a schematic stepped out in axes fractions, or a mosaic dense enough that the constrained solver reports cells collapsed to zero and silently falls back — has to say so, because an engine that gives up still leaves the figure laid out by a fallback nobody declared." ;
                                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/figure> ;
                                     <https://w3id.org/linkml/permissible_values> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/LayoutEngine#compressed> ,
                                                                                  <https://w3id.org/tvbo/LayoutEngine#constrained> ,
                                                                                  <https://w3id.org/tvbo/LayoutEngine#none> ,
                                                                                  <https://w3id.org/tvbo/LayoutEngine#tight> .


