                               rdfs:label "Region" ;
                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A rectangle drawn over a panel to ring the window a paper calls out — the parameter band a regime lives in, the interval a statistic was taken over. Declared rather than drawn by a custom callable, so the window a figure highlights is part of the spec that can be read back." ;
