                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/common> ;
                                   <https://w3id.org/linkml/permissible_values> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReportPart#main> ,
                                                                                <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ReportPart#supplementary> .


