                               rdfs:label "Volume" ;
                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A labelled-volume panel's geometry: the volumetric counterpart of `Surface`, same layer and same colour scale, with the geometry coming from an atlas instead of a mesh. Values are placed BY LABEL through the atlas crosswalk, never by array position." ;
                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/figure> .


