                                                           rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                                           rdfs:label "from_experiment (InitialStateMethod)" ;
                                                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Seed from the settled endpoint state of another already-run experiment in the study (referenced by InitialState.source_experiment). Reuses a working point that experiment already reached instead of recomputing it — the cross-experiment counterpart of from_working_point (which recomputes the ramp inline). source_point selects which settled point of the source run (default 'endpoint')." ;
                                                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "from_experiment" .


###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/InitialStateMethod#from_working_point
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/InitialStateMethod#from_working_point> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                              rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/tvbo/InitialStateMethod> ;
                                                              rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                                              rdfs:label "from_working_point (InitialStateMethod)" ;
                                                              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ramp a parameter quasi-statically (warm-start / from_previous) to a target value (see InitialState.ramp) and start from the endpoint state — reach a working point on the solution branch before the run." ;
                                                              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "from_working_point" .


###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/InitialStateMethod#given
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/InitialStateMethod#given> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                 rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/tvbo/InitialStateMethod> ;
                                                 rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                                 rdfs:label "given (InitialStateMethod)" ;
                                                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Start from the model's declared initial values as they are. A continuation takes them as its starting equilibrium on every continuation backend, and refuses a state whose right-hand side exceeds InitialState.abs_tol in any component, since AUTO-07p would start its branch at a state that is not an equilibrium and BifurcationKit would correct it first; newton finds the equilibrium near such a state." ;
                                                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "given" .


###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/InitialStateMethod#newton
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/InitialStateMethod#newton> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                  rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/tvbo/InitialStateMethod> ;
                                                  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                                  rdfs:label "newton (InitialStateMethod)" ;
                                                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Start from the equilibrium Newton's method converges to from the model's declared initial values: SciPy's root by MINPACK's hybr, to a relative step of InitialState.abs_tol, refused where it does not converge. Resolved once, before any backend runs, so every continuation backend starts from the same state; on a network every node starts from it." ;
                                                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "newton" .


###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/InitialStateMethod#time_integration
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/InitialStateMethod#time_integration> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                            rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/tvbo/InitialStateMethod> ;
                                                            rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                                            rdfs:label "time_integration (InitialStateMethod)" ;
                                                            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Integrate the model from its declared initial values for InitialState.duration and start from the state it reaches. The default of a continuation, on every continuation backend." ;
                                                            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "time_integration" .


###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/LayoutEngine#compressed
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LayoutEngine#compressed> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/tvbo/LayoutEngine> ;
                                                rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                                rdfs:label "compressed (LayoutEngine)" ;
                                                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Constrained, then pull fixed-aspect axes together so equal-aspect panels leave no gap between them." ;
                                                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "compressed" .


###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/LayoutEngine#constrained
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LayoutEngine#constrained> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                 rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/tvbo/LayoutEngine> ;
                                                 rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                                 rdfs:label "constrained (LayoutEngine)" ;
                                                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Solve the margins so no decoration overlaps another panel. The general-purpose engine." ;
                                                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "constrained" .


###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/LayoutEngine#none
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LayoutEngine#none> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                          rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/tvbo/LayoutEngine> ;
                                          rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                          rdfs:label "none (LayoutEngine)" ;
                                          <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "No engine: every axes keeps the position its gridspec cell gives it, and anything placed at absolute geometry survives the draw." ;
                                          <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "none" .


###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/LayoutEngine#tight
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/LayoutEngine#tight> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                           rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/tvbo/LayoutEngine> ;
                                           rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                           rdfs:label "tight (LayoutEngine)" ;
                                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Adjust the subplot parameters after the fact to fit the decorations. No solver, so it cannot honour a shared aspect." ;
                                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "tight" .


