###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/SelectionScope#run
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SelectionScope#run> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                           rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/tvbo/SelectionScope> ;
                                           rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                           rdfs:label "run (SelectionScope)" ;
                                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "One best iterate over all stages jointly, restored after the last stage (the default)." ;
                                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "run" .


###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/SelectionScope#stage
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/SelectionScope#stage> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                             rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/tvbo/SelectionScope> ;
                                             rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                             rdfs:label "stage (SelectionScope)" ;
                                             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Each stage keeps its own best iterate and restores it before the next stage starts, so every stage restarts from the best state the previous one found; the run records one iteration and value per stage. This is the authors' released feedback-inhibition protocol, where each stage was a separate process that restarted from the previous stage's best checkpoint." ;
                                             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "stage" .


