###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/TickPlacement#declared
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/TickPlacement#declared> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                               rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/tvbo/TickPlacement> ;
                                               rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                               rdfs:label "declared (TickPlacement)" ;
                                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The ticks each panel gives in `xticks` and `yticks`, and nothing else. A numeric axis that gives none is refused, so a figure under this rule carries no tick nobody chose." ;
                                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "declared" .


###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/TickPlacement#native
