                                           <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The main element in a LEMS Simulation file. Defines the _length of simulation, the timestep (dt) _step and an optional _seed to use for stochastic elements, as well as _Display_s, _OutputFile_s and _EventOutputFile_s to record. Specifies a _target component to run, usually the id of a _network_"@en ;
                                           rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                           rdfs:label "Simulation"@en ;
                                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://www.neuroml.org/schema/neuroml2#Simulation> ;
                                           <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/hasParameter> "length" ,
                                                                                        "step" .


