###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/decayingPoolConcentrationModel
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/decayingPoolConcentrationModel> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                               rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/concentrationModel> ;
                                                               <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Model of an intracellular buffering mechanism for _ion (currently hard Coded to be calcium, due to requirement for _iCa) which has a baseline level _restingConc and tends to this value with time course _decayConstant. The ion is assumed to occupy a shell inside the membrane of thickness _shellThickness."@en ;
                                                               rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                                               rdfs:label "decayingPoolConcentrationModel"@en ;
                                                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://www.neuroml.org/schema/neuroml2#decayingPoolConcentrationModel> ;
                                                               <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/hasParameter> "decayConstant" ,
                                                                                                            "restingConc" ,
                                                                                                            "shellThickness" ;
                                                               <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/requires> "iCa" .


