###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/ionChannel
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/ionChannel> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                           rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/ionChannelHH> ;
                                           <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Note _ionChannel_ and _ionChannelHH_ are currently functionally identical. This is needed since many existing examples use ionChannel, some use ionChannelHH. NeuroML v2beta4 should remove one of these, probably ionChannelHH."@en ;
