                                       <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Specifies the _segment_ which is this segment's parent. The _fractionAlong specifies where it is connected, usually 1 (the default value), meaning the _distal_ point of the parent, or 0, meaning the _proximal_ point. If it is between these, a linear interpolation between the 2 points should be used."@en ;
                                       rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                       rdfs:label "parent"@en ;
                                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://www.neuroml.org/schema/neuroml2#parent> .


