                                                <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Dimensionless equivalent of _rampGenerator_. Generates a ramping current after a time _delay, for a fixed _duration. During this time the dimensionless current steadily changes from _startAmplitude to _finishAmplitude. Scaled by _weight, if set"@en ;
                                                rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                                rdfs:label "rampGeneratorDL"@en ;
                                                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://www.neuroml.org/schema/neuroml2#rampGeneratorDL> ;
