                                                <https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/hasParameter> "baselineAmplitude" ,
                                                                                             "delay" ,
                                                                                             "duration" ,
                                                                                             "finishAmplitude" ,
                                                                                             "startAmplitude" .


###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml/rectangularExtent
