###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/CouplingDependentAuxiliaryRecording
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/CouplingDependentAuxiliaryRecording> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                     <https://w3id.org/tvbo/SimulationTask> ;
                                                            <https://w3id.org/tvbo/requiresCapability> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/PerStageCouplingEvaluation> ;
                                                            rdfs:comment "Recording (via `output` or `record: true`) a derived/auxiliary variable whose equation reads a coupling input, with the auxiliary aligned to the state it is recorded alongside. Under the default per-step (frozen) coupling the recorded auxiliary carries the step-start coupling — one integration step behind the recorded post-step state — so exact state/coupling alignment requires per-stage coupling evaluation."@en ;
                                                            rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                                            rdfs:label "Coupling-dependent auxiliary recording"@en .


