                                                  <https://w3id.org/tvbo/AnalysisObservable> ;
                                         rdfs:comment "Benettin QR estimate of the tangent-dynamics Lyapunov spectrum: the leading exponents lambda_i (rate of trajectory divergence, chaos when lambda_1 > 0) and, for the leading direction, the per-node Lyapunov vector xi_i (which nodes drive the instability). Parameters: n_exponents, n_steps (rescaling segments), segment_time, mode (tangent-space jvp / two-trajectory sim). Independent per operating point, so it fans out across a parameter axis."@en ;
                                         rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                         rdfs:label "Lyapunov analysis"@en ;
                                         <https://w3id.org/tvbo/realisedByBackend> "tvboptim" .


