###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/PerStageCouplingEvaluation
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/PerStageCouplingEvaluation> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                            <https://w3id.org/tvbo/BackendCapability> ;
                                                   rdfs:comment "The network coupling is re-evaluated at every stage of a multi-stage integrator (a full part of the vector field) instead of being frozen once per step. Backend-independent numerical contract carried by `Integration.coupling_evaluation: per_stage` (tvboptim maps this to recompute_coupling_per_stage=True; diffrax recomputes the whole RHS per stage regardless)."@en ;
                                                   rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                                   rdfs:label "Per-stage coupling evaluation"@en ;
                                                   <https://w3id.org/tvbo/enabledByIntegrationSlot> "coupling_evaluation:per_stage" .


