                                                      <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Dynamics> ;
                                             <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> """The Hindmarsh-Rose model reproduces the bursting behavior of a neuron's membrane
potential, characterized by a fast sequence of spikes followed by a quiescent period.
