                                                 <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Dynamics> ;
                                        <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> """Ten-dimensional explicit expansion of the Lorenz-96 system: dx_i/dt = (x_{i+1} - x_{i-2}) x_{i-1} - x_i + F
with cyclic indices modulo N (here N=10 unrolled to avoid symbolic indexing that the
