###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/LorenzBounded
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/LorenzBounded> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                      <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Dynamics> ;
                                             <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> """Lorenz system modified by smooth radial confinement factor f = 1 - (||X||^2)/r^2
producing bounded dynamics with altered basin geometry while retaining core
stretching and folding mechanisms.""" ;
