###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/SupHopf
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/SupHopf> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Dynamics> ;
                                       <https://w3id.org/tvbo/exhibitsBifurcation> _:genid5077 ;
