                                                                    rdfs:label "r_E (CakanObermayer derived variable)" ;
                                                                    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "r_E" .


###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/CakanObermayer/derived_variables/r_I
