                                                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "Iext" .


###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor2D/parameters/Ks
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor2D/parameters/Ks> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                  <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> ;
