                                                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> """Temporal scaling in the slow state-variable, \\
        called :math:`1\\tau_{0}` in Jirsa paper (see class Epileptor).""" ;
                                                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "r" .


