                                                                      rdfs:label "sigma_y0_1 (JansenRit derived variable)" ;
                                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "sigma_y0_1" .


###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/JansenRit/derived_variables/sigma_y0_3
