                                                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "F" .


###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Lorenz96/parameters/N
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Lorenz96/parameters/N> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                              <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> ;
                                                     <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Number of state variables (dimension explicitly expanded below)." ;
                                                     <http://schema.org/defaultValue> 10 ;
