###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/MagneticPendulum/parameters/gamma
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/MagneticPendulum/parameters/gamma> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                          <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> ;
                                                                 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Base magnetic strength γ (if γs not explicitly varied)." ;
