###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/MontbrioPazoRoxin/state_variables/V
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/MontbrioPazoRoxin/state_variables/V> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                            <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> ;
                                                                   <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(V, t)" ;
                                                                   <https://w3id.org/tvbo/rhs> "(I + J*r*tau + V**2 + c_glob0*cr*tau + c_glob1*cv + eta - pi**2*r**2*tau**2)/tau" ;
                                                                   rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                                                   rdfs:label "V (MontbrioPazoRoxin state variable)" ;
                                                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "V" .


###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/MontbrioPazoRoxin/state_variables/r
