###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/RiddledBasins/state_variables/vx
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/RiddledBasins/state_variables/vx> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                         <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> ;
