###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/SprottDissipativeConservative/parameters/a
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/SprottDissipativeConservative/parameters/a> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                   <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter> ;
                                                                          <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Nonlinear mixed term coefficient a." ;
