###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/SwingingAtwood/state_variables/omega
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/SwingingAtwood/state_variables/omega> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                             <https://w3id.org/tvbo/StateVariable> ;
                                                                    <https://w3id.org/tvbo/lhs> "Derivative(omega, t)" ;
