                                                                    rdfs:label "SS0 (TsodyksMarkram derived variable)" ;
                                                                    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "SS0" .


###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/TsodyksMarkram/derived_variables/SS1
