###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/networks/tpl-MNI152NLin2009cAsym_cohort-HCPYA_rec-avgMatrix_atlas-DesikanKilliany_desc-SCFC_relmat
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/networks/tpl-MNI152NLin2009cAsym_cohort-HCPYA_rec-avgMatrix_atlas-DesikanKilliany_desc-SCFC_relmat> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                                                                    <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Network> ;
                                                                                                                           <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Group-average connectome of the HCP Young Adult S900 release on 84 Desikan-Killiany regions, 34 cortical, 7 subcortical and the cerebellar cortex per hemisphere: normalised streamline counts (`weight`) and mean tract lengths (`length`) from diffusion MRI, and the Pearson correlation of resting-state BOLD (`fc`). The arrays are tvboptim's `dk_average` (`src/tvboptim/data/connectivity/dk_average/data.npz` and `functional/dk_average/data.npz`), cast to float32 by `scripts/import_tvboptim_networks.py` (commit 2f6c965c6); `networks/bids/dk_average/dataset_description.json` lists Schirner, Deco and Ritter (2023) under `SourceDatasets`." ;
                                                                                                                           rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                                                                                                           rdfs:label "tpl-MNI152NLin2009cAsym_cohort-HCPYA_rec-avgMatrix_atlas-DesikanKilliany_desc-SCFC_relmat" ;
                                                                                                                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "DesikanKilliany (avgMatrix SC+FC)" ;
                                                                                                                           <https://w3id.org/tvbo/hasParameter> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/networks/tpl-MNI152NLin2009cAsym_cohort-HCPYA_rec-avgMatrix_atlas-DesikanKilliany_desc-SCFC_relmat/parameters/conduction_speed> .


###  https://w3id.org/tvbo/networks/tpl-MNI152NLin2009cAsym_cohort-HCPYA_rec-avgMatrix_atlas-Lobar8_desc-SCFC_relmat
<https://w3id.org/tvbo/networks/tpl-MNI152NLin2009cAsym_cohort-HCPYA_rec-avgMatrix_atlas-Lobar8_desc-SCFC_relmat> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                                                           <https://w3id.org/tvbo/Network> ;
                                                                                                                  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The Desikan-Killiany avgMatrix network `tvbo:networks/tpl-MNI152NLin2009cAsym_cohort-HCPYA_rec-avgMatrix_atlas-DesikanKilliany_desc-SCFC_relmat`, and so the HCP Young Adult S900 group average, aggregated to 8 lobes per hemisphere by `compute_lobar_avgmatrix` and `build_lobar8_network` in `scripts/create_lobar_network.py` (commit 25b293c40). Each of a hemisphere's 42 regions joins one lobe by the script's `DK_ABBREV_TO_LOBE`: 11 cortical regions Frontal, 5 Parietal, 9 Temporal, 4 Occipital, 4 Cingulate and the insula Insular; the thalamus, caudate, putamen, pallidum, hippocampus, amygdala and accumbens Subcortical; the cerebellar cortex Cerebellum. For each pair of lobes, over every pair of their regions, a region paired with itself included, `weight` is the mean weight, `length` the mean tract length weighted by the weights (the sum of weight times length over the sum of weights) and `fc` the mean correlation; the Desikan-Killiany diagonal is zero in all three." ;
                                                                                                                  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                                                                                                  rdfs:label "tpl-MNI152NLin2009cAsym_cohort-HCPYA_rec-avgMatrix_atlas-Lobar8_desc-SCFC_relmat" ;
                                                                                                                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Lobar8 (avgMatrix)" ;
