                               rdfs:label "frames (slot)" ;
                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "How many frames to draw. Unset draws one per position along `over`, which for a simulation is one frame per integration sample and is almost never what a figure wants; a smaller number subsamples the axis evenly, so a 600 000-step run becomes a movie of the length declared here." ;
                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/figure> ;
                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "frames" .


