                               rdfs:label "gather (slot)" ;
                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Observer parameter ``(n_groups, n)`` of node indices selecting each group's nodes out of the whole-source signal; its leading axis is the group count." ;
                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> ;
                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "gather" .


