                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo> ;
                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "region" .


<https://w3id.org/tvbo/regions> rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
