<https://w3id.org/tvbo/study/subjects_file> rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/tvbo/tvbo.owl> ;
                                            rdfs:label "subjects_file (study)" ;
                                            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Path of a file that lists this dataset's subjects, in place of ``subjects``; a dataset states one of the two. A ``.yaml`` or ``.json`` file holds what ``subjects`` would hold (identifiers, ``Subject`` records or a mapping keyed by identifier), a ``.tsv`` or ``.csv`` file is a participants table read by its ``participant_id`` column, and any other file holds one identifier per line. Read each time the subjects are asked for and resolved as ``Cohort.members_file`` is, with the same rule for what a message may say." ;
                                            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/study> ;
                                            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "subjects_file" .


